function init(){defaults({owners:{},rewards:[{id:'r1',name:'决定一次家庭桌游',cost:15},{id:'r2',name:'选择周末家庭活动',cost:25}],redemptions:[]})}init();
const earned=()=>state.weeks.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.points,0),balance=()=>earned()-p.redemptions.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.cost,0),pending=()=>state.tasks.filter(x=>x.done).reduce((a,x)=>a+x.points,0);
function taskEditor(id){const t=state.tasks.find(x=>x.id===id);editModal(t?'修改家务':'添加一件家务',field('要做什么','name','text',t?.name||'','required maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：晚饭后收拾餐桌"')+field('谁来完成（用代号）','owner','text',p.owners[id]||'我','required maxlength="20"')+field('完成后获得多少积分','points','number',t?.points||5,'required min="1" max="100"'),v=>{if(t){Object.assign(t,{name:v.name,points:+v.points});p.owners[id]=v.owner}else{const id=uid();state.tasks.push({id,name:v.name,points:+v.points,done:false});p.owners[id]=v.owner}commit('家务安排已保存')});if(t){$('#edit-form').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',btn('移除这件家务','remove-task','danger'));on('remove-task',()=>{state.tasks=state.tasks.filter(x=>x.id!==id);delete p.owners[id];closeModal();commit('家务已移除，可撤销')})}}
function rewardEditor(id){const r=p.rewards.find(x=>x.id===id);editModal(r?'修改小奖励':'约定一个小奖励',field('奖励内容','name','text',r?.name||'','required maxlength="60"')+field('需要多少积分','cost','number',r?.cost||15,'required min="1" max="10000"'),v=>{if(r)Object.assign(r,{name:v.name,cost:+v.cost});else p.rewards.push({id:uid(),name:v.name,cost:+v.cost});commit()});if(r){$('#edit-form').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',btn('移除这个奖励','remove-reward','danger'));on('remove-reward',()=>{p.rewards=p.rewards.filter(x=>x.id!==id);closeModal();commit('奖励已移除，历史兑换保留')})}}
function render(){nav();const done=state.tasks.filter(x=>x.done).length;
 if(active===0){$('#app').innerHTML=`<div class="two-col"><div>${hero('我的家庭贡献',`${pending()}<small>分待存入</small>`,`${done} / ${state.tasks.length} 件家务已完成`,'coins')}${heading('今天，帮一点小忙',btn('＋ 添加家务','add',''))}<div class="list">${list(state.tasks,t=>`<article class="list-item ${t.done?'complete':''}">${check('done',t.id,t.done,(t.done?'撤销完成':'完成')+t.name)}<div class="content"><strong>${esc(t.name)}</strong><p>${esc(p.owners[t.id]||'我')} · ${t.points} 积分</p></div><button data-edit="${t.id}" aria-label="修改${esc(t.name)}">${icon('edit')}</button></article>`)}</div></div><aside class="stack"><section class="card"><span class="eyebrow">积分小存折</span><h2 style="margin:10px 0">可兑换 ${balance()} 分</h2><p class="hint">做完后和家人一起确认，把贡献存进积分银行。</p><div style="margin-top:20px">${btn('确认完成，存入积分','settle','primary full',!pending())}</div></section><div class="subtle">一起商量积分和分工。家务也可以是两个人的合作任务。</div></aside></div>`;on('add',()=>taskEditor());actions('edit',taskEditor);actions('done',id=>{const t=state.tasks.find(x=>x.id===id);t.done=!t.done;commit(t.done?'完成一件小事，真不错！':'已撤销完成')});on('settle',()=>confirmAction('一起确认这些家务完成了吗？',`本次存入 ${pending()} 分，已完成任务将重新变为待做。`,()=>{state.weeks.push({date:today(),points:pending(),count:done});state.tasks.forEach(t=>t.done=false);commit('积分已存入，可以去看看奖励啦')}));}
 if(active===1){$('#app').innerHTML=`${hero('我的奖励基金',`${balance()}<small>积分</small>`,'每一份贡献，都离小期待更近一点。','gift')}${heading('和家人约定的奖励',btn('＋ 新奖励','reward-add',''))}<div class="two-col">${p.rewards.map(r=>`<section class="card"><div class="between"><div class="tile-icon">${icon('gift')}</div><button data-rewardedit="${r.id}">修改</button></div><h3 style="margin:16px 0 8px">${esc(r.name)}</h3><p class="hint">${r.cost} 积分${balance()<r.cost?` · 还差 ${r.cost-balance()} 分`:''}</p><button class="primary full" style="margin-top:18px" data-redeem="${r.id}" ${balance()<r.cost?'disabled':''}>兑换这个奖励</button></section>`).join('')}</div>`;actions('redeem',id=>{const r=p.rewards.find(x=>x.id===id);confirmAction('兑换这个奖励？',`${esc(r.name)}，需要 ${r.cost} 积分。`,()=>{if(balance()<r.cost)return toast('积分还不够');p.redemptions.push({...r,id:uid(),date:today()});commit('已兑换，和家人一起安排吧')})});on('reward-add',()=>rewardEditor());actions('rewardedit',rewardEditor);}
 if(active===2){$('#app').innerHTML=`${heading('我的积分存折')}<div class="two-col"><section class="card"><h3>存入记录</h3>${list([...state.weeks].reverse(),w=>`<div class="list-item"><div class="content"><strong>完成 ${w.count} 件家务</strong><p>${w.date}</p></div><span class="value">+${w.points}</span></div>`)}</section><section class="card"><h3>奖励记录</h3>${list([...p.redemptions].reverse(),r=>`<div class="list-item"><div class="content"><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><p>${r.date} · −${r.cost} 分</p></div><button data-cancel="${r.id}">退回</button></div>`)}</section></div>`;actions('cancel',id=>confirmAction('退回这次兑换？','奖励记录会移除，积分会返还。',()=>{p.redemptions=p.redemptions.filter(x=>x.id!==id);commit('积分已返还')}))}
}
shell([['家务','home'],['奖励','gift'],['存折','wallet']]);render();
